WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.250
Here is the private SpecWeave Studio

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:02.970
pilot.

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:04.370
Open Providers.

00:00:04.490 --> 00:00:05.610
Select the machine,

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.610
then inspect its native provider and

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:08.610
account state.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.970
Keep credentials on their owning host.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.610
Studio brings native coding sessions into

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:14.650
one workbench,

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:15.450
with plans,

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:16.170
approvals,

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:17.170
and checkpoints.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.690
SpecWeave keeps task ownership.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:21.530
Explore the architecture and ask about

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:23.050
a pilot at spec weave dot

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.730
com slash studio.